s item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Rock_Boots_(Level_11).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Rock_Boots_%28Level_11%29.png/420px-Rock_Boots_%28Level_11%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"366\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Rock_Boots_%28Level_11%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>These boots are encased in a stony shell, bolstered by the power of a bound Earth Elemental. They allow the user to execute a ferocious stomp that knocks nearby enimes over, as well as turning your attackers to stone on occasion.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817224826\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.122 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.164 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7718/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61292/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18931/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  137.105      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00